    "detailed_description": "An odd looking forest full odd places, filled with dark corners and many strange faces.<br />\r\nA blank slate awakens on one fateful morning, unsure of your purpose, you take on a journey.<br />\r\nA world full of tales, mystery, doubt. It'll take a detective to figure it out.<br />\r\nA soil of sadness, an intertwined net, the deeper you dig, the grimmer it'll get.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe lay of this land is unfriendly and dark, be sure to prepare for quests you embark.<br />\r\nDoubt not, you'll encounter vast strangers and fiends. Old creatures, unnerved, undead and unseen.<br />\r\nPrevail and survive or turn into dust., make smart use of acquired resources you must.<br />\r\nThe day and night roll and with them change tides. By day you must scavenge, by night you must hide.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd still you're a subject of human afflictions, to dig up the story within this dark fiction,<br />\r\nExplore and discover, and harvest and sow, craft tools and brew substance to aid in your goal.<br />\r\nCrawl though deep, glum crevice, reach heights of unseen, engage in a conflict of humans within.<br />\r\nThe further you reach the more will story unveil, the more you will find there's much more to this tale.",
    "about_the_game": "An odd looking forest full odd places, filled with dark corners and many strange faces.<br />\r\nA blank slate awakens on one fateful morning, unsure of your purpose, you take on a journey.<br />\r\nA world full of tales, mystery, doubt. It'll take a detective to figure it out.<br />\r\nA soil of sadness, an intertwined net, the deeper you dig, the grimmer it'll get.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe lay of this land is unfriendly and dark, be sure to prepare for quests you embark.<br />\r\nDoubt not, you'll encounter vast strangers and fiends. Old creatures, unnerved, undead and unseen.<br />\r\nPrevail and survive or turn into dust., make smart use of acquired resources you must.<br />\r\nThe day and night roll and with them change tides. By day you must scavenge, by night you must hide.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd still you're a subject of human afflictions, to dig up the story within this dark fiction,<br />\r\nExplore and discover, and harvest and sow, craft tools and brew substance to aid in your goal.<br />\r\nCrawl though deep, glum crevice, reach heights of unseen, engage in a conflict of humans within.<br />\r\nThe further you reach the more will story unveil, the more you will find there's much more to this tale.",
    "short_description": "A 3rd person, quest based, survival horror journey, with a heavy lean on narrative, mystery, exploration and detective work. Uncover the circumstances behind the grim world you awaken in, and in the process learn the truth by piecing together the many character stories clues and puzzles",
